OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval rings uncovered in fields
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 15th Century rings discovered by a
OL,7,Fmetal detectorist in North Yorkshire
OL,8,Fare to be auctioned next week.
OL,10,FAndrew Riley, 71, struck gold twice in
OL,11,Fthe space of four months when he found
OL,12,Fthe medieval rings at a farm near
OL,13,FNorthallerton.
OL,15,FThe rings, one of which has been named
OL,16,Fthe 'blood of Christ' ring by
OL,17,Fauctioneers and the other an
OL,18,Ficonographic ring of St Margaret of
OL,19,FAntioch, could fetch more than #10,000
OL,20,Fat auction.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
