OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval rings uncovered in fields
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FRiley, who plans to split the proceeds
OL,7,Fwith the landowner, said he was so
OL,8,Fshocked after the discoveries he had to
OL,9,F"lie down".
